  m_text: " Daniel woke up in his apartment with unbearable vertigo. His sleep had
    been restless. It felt like he had been dreaming about something. \n\r\n Someone
    had messed up his home: some things were not in their usual places. Perhaps if
    he put everything back where it belonged, the vertigo would stop."
